[{"title":"游大云山寺","author":"赵崇经","text":"何年卓锡寄遐踪，阁道悬崖碍短筇。\n初地人烟寒薜荔，诸天秋色锁芙蓉。\n云霾万壑晴还雨，风啸千林午亦钟。\n老大息心持半偈，支公玄度好相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32362,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"振衣千仞为礼部汤显祖题","author":"李渐","text":"翩翩旌旆壮游观，寄迹朱明臈意寒。\n人在半空鸣玉佩，日从疏木照玄冠。\n铁桥风过泉初急，丹灶霞深石未乾。\n忽问英州唐别驾，伫看驱轸上长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32363,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺","author":"钟万奇","text":"飞殿虚无倚戟峰，梦回曲涧忽鸣钟。\n窗呼六面幽光入，云界中流翠影重。\n急电双螭翻石壁，素秋一剑削芙蓉。\n兴来顿觉探奇好，举眼能令万事慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32364,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羊城即事","author":"张嗣垣","text":"不觉清明后，珠江客未还。\n又看三月尽，曾得几时閒。\n皂帽难逃世，青衫易负山。\n劳劳随逆旅，争席卖鱼阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32365,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花","author":"张嗣垣","text":"名花只好富家开，不为贫家不解栽。\n便有花开仍落去，也无人送酒钱来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32366,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李卫使伯修舟中小集","author":"张嗣垣","text":"小驿新秋色，江乡薄暮天。\n人家栖断岸，官树阁寒烟。\n几度乘潮稳，船窗借月悬。\n将军多野趣，留客共清言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32367,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中 其一","author":"张嗣垣","text":"幽事关心剧，兼旬出未能。\n春风修褉帖，秋夜短檠灯。\n戒茗常辞客，除荤却似僧。\n登山旧时脚，留得骨棱棱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32368,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中 其二","author":"张嗣垣","text":"故态今无似，其如五不堪。\n日高暝子舍，夏至拥春衫。\n病后诗情苦，潮来水味咸。\n亲交时问讯，裁报只空函。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32369,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中 其三","author":"张嗣垣","text":"玉露催黄叶，金声起素商。\n乍能消酷暑，翻自怯新凉。\n多病惭司马，全生愧牧羊。\n有怀殊不寐，真觉夜能长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32370,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中 其四","author":"张嗣垣","text":"经时亲药物，一向掩柴关。\n枕上眠看画，帘中坐见山。\n纵无三岁艾，赢得半年閒。\n小试花间步，轻身已不难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32371,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居 其一","author":"张嗣垣","text":"谁言吾道拙谋身，买得青山绝世尘。\n薖轴难忘须是癖，箪瓢犹在末全贫。\n林泉不用疑逋客，鹿豕何妨狎野人。\n独恨向平休不蚤，几年儿女负松云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32372,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居 其二","author":"张嗣垣","text":"历历仙原隔翠岚，幽人杖屦总相谙。\n花间流水通泉穴，云外攒峰秘石岩。\n得意流连呼鹤舞，閒情来往约僧谈。\n生涯剩有长镵在，耕遍烟霞不戒贪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32373,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日冒雨同林习修诸子游彭峒山","author":"张嗣垣","text":"寒合千峰马到难，瘦藤高倚翠微间。\n磴拖烟树来岩屋，泉迸天花满石坛。\n红日弄晴浑欲漏，白云成雨却知还。\n浪游彊待留诗去，自笑慵疏不耐烦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32374,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友自粤西入楚","author":"张嗣垣","text":"东西一水望盈盈，风物山川旧有名。\n作客易牵怀古恨，送君难解别时情。\n绿珠歌舞春云散，白傅琵琶秋月明。\n好向苍梧多市酒，深杯能遣旅愁轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32375,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后一日采菱陈家洲 其一","author":"张嗣垣","text":"烟水茫茫带浦沙，兰桡容与入蒹葭。\n紫菱不负今朝酒，黄菊还簪昨日花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32376,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后一日采菱陈家洲 其二","author":"张嗣垣","text":"江头天气老渔知，见说秋来异别时。\n鲈脍莼羹君莫恋，西风吹断钓鱼丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村杂兴 其一","author":"张嗣垣","text":"前村烟火有无间，疏树离离映浅湾。\n向晚微风吹雨去，片帆遥带夕阳还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村杂兴 其二","author":"张嗣垣","text":"荔子矶头隔藕花，凫翁队里尽渔家。\n前溪钓伴时相访，门外垂杨系短槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过端上人庵不遇","author":"张嗣垣","text":"石桥分水晓香台，门掩疏钟昼不开。\n曾是木樨花下客，年年今日又重来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕杂诗","author":"张嗣垣","text":"双星适度夜云收，穿罢金针始欲愁。\n巧学天孙容易得，只妨夫婿似牵牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阙题","author":"刘克平","text":"兰桡飞渡浈江月，紫阁摇空石突兀。\n海日初生山雾开，乘兴因之讨奇绝。\n孤高宝刹霾云端，古木蒙茸山势盘。\n禺阳截竹吹管去，灵宫何意留其间。\n仙之人兮时税驾，我岂后兮今跻攀。\n碧天无际真人想，顿忘身谪向人寰。\n江入大空深不测，缘知独有蛟龙蟠。\n老衲看成精舍石，白泡汇作清溪潭。\n榛甃舍利金轮灭，韦氏园林花树残。\n犀沉谁为留金锁，猿去何知解玉环。\n以兹振衣不厌高，翩翩直上凌层峦。\n青天咳唾堕珠玉，白昼红颜生羽翰。\n千层山色沉江底，九点芳烟暗碧湾。\n二仪低悬槛外海，百粤势拊寺前山。\n烟霞幻变人间世，云雾湿压清昼寒。\n便欲举杯酬二字，何当同跨双飞鸾。\n凭高远豁万里目，朗诵淮南一破颜。\n大都无际沧波上，惟有群飞鸥鹭閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游龙潭","author":"刘克平","text":"叠嶂层峦紫翠中，旧知雷雨起蛟龙。\n只今磴道千盘折，天末何年一夜风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮绝顶放歌","author":"刘克平","text":"楼船海上迷烟涛，金盘仙露秋风高。\n咸阳三月成煨烬，茂陵到处生蓬蒿。\n岂知仙岛波光上，轻于弱水之浮毫。\n漂萍无根津无托，浮山已在罗山泊。\n共工怒触愚公愚，女娲山神无所需。\n如今影落天池外，往往疑是北溟鱼。\n我乘飙车驾三蹻，徘徊倒影双笼鸟。\n轻风吹衣挂云端，误唾珠玑落天表。\n天表无远近，罗浮咫尺间。\n九节白玉杖，相将入玄关。\n玄关杳窱混太清，紫云为盖青云城。\n俯视三万六千尺，日月虽照何冥冥。\n泉源流水深不测，瑶石璇台列其侧。\n征翼名足声空闻，乍高巘兮忽长林。\n波激石兮碎玉，石咽波兮鏦金。\n芝有年而驾车，木无影而千寻。\n凤喈喈兮浴潭，龙冉冉兮布霖。\n忽层云斐亹以出没兮，似波涛运海翻千万里之鲲鹏。\n风淜滂飘拂其缘阿兮，嚣喧洼窍散入华叶容与于众芬。\n邈仙洞之窈窅兮，纷夜乐之鋞鈜。\n啸乍舒而纵腭，歌转哀而激唇。\n九疑三湘烟雾敛，大地月色同纷纷。\n零露瀼兮白皎皎，寒威肃兮夜沉沉。\n吹万忽兮悄悄，微飙静兮泠泠。\n仙之人兮下云軿，划连幛兮列屏。\n命吹笙兮董双成，鼓震灵之璈兮许飞琼。\n寒苍麟兮酌玄英，授瑶笈兮妙韫，传大药兮长生。\n指挥上界路何遥，试望沧海今扬尘。\n盍归来兮清虚天，世之人兮难与群。\n关门既回车，刀圭讵试君。\n张良眷恋亦王汉，刘安迟迟但埋金。\n噫吁嘻，送君行行当安之，别离有尽会有期。\n君再来兮餐紫芝，但恐二女侍，头白成衰婺。\n珍重玄都约莫语，此辈元痴儿，来兮当何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"候潮扶胥江","author":"刘克平","text":"浊浪愁三老，残星恋客舟。\n岸遥看不见，潮上暗能流。\n海色疑无夜，江风别有秋。\n双鸾孤枕上，清梦已罗浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过梅庵禅寺","author":"刘克平","text":"随意沧洲傲，玄关晚共过。\n捍江青嶂逼，碍杖白云多。\n地僻閒樵牧，人稀老薜萝。\n采真与汗漫，不负紫芝歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经湛文简钓台","author":"刘克平","text":"四百峰头云不开，孤骞眠底暂徘徊。\n虎门江入天无际，蜃气波翻岳半推。\n信有儒宗高一代，何应长算只孤台。\n乾坤此日吾登望，水落鱼龙万壑哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32387,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"延祥寺故地","author":"刘克平","text":"觉路金绳得并过，诸天翘首望藤罗。\n怪来白马神功在，何必玄蜂旷宇多。\n无树菩提从拂拭，有缘知识岂蹉跎。\n清泠一漱通公井，去住谁应佛祖诃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32388,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登文昌宫延禧宝塔","author":"刘克平","text":"芙蓉青削海天中，去住吾生此断蓬。\n转世谁知金粟佛，凭高聊御太王风。\n十年两度题诗过，千界诸山入眼同。\n莫遣淹留催落日，暮云天外乱归鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32389,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感时","author":"赵鹤良","text":"北望自心惊，黄巾扰未平。\n材官充上国，车骑满边城。\n处处输钱粟，人人苦革兵。\n妖氛如未扫，何以请长缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32390,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登东山绝顶","author":"谢如玉","text":"天辟灵源一字开，倦游司马独登台。\n三江秋色当轩尽，两粤风烟动地来。\n屐齿兴酣凌绝巘，鹖冠愁对酌孤罍。\n白云万里思华发，转动江南庾信哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32391,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇海楼送刘职方还留都","author":"霍尚守","text":"城北高悬朝汉台，可怜玉砌半蒿莱。\n孤鸿似写尉佗恨，声入清秋听转哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云洞","author":"霍尚守","text":"云石参差鸟道迷，纤尘不到称幽栖。\n半空泉落蛟龙斗，绝巘岩悬日月低。\n涧畔桂丛春自长，峰前霞色暮堪携。\n胜游休讶清狂客，更上丹崖万仞梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱宴集","author":"霍尚守","text":"七日留仙岛，相看叹转蓬。\n瑶池寒色满，丹井紫烟丛。\n何处来山简，高怀并孟公。\n笙歌天上落，兴剧月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端溪夜泊","author":"霍尚守","text":"停棹依寒岛，听潮夜不眠。\n中天双塔出，绝岸一灯悬。\n江树遥连峡，溪云半上船。\n梵钟惊旅梦，聊赋远游篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喷玉岩别卢紫伯","author":"霍尚守","text":"玄冬冲雪访丹丘，曲涧飞觞叶并流。\n万里云霄双醉眼，百年踪迹一虚舟。\n鸣泉晓落仙筝发，古树晴悬翠幄浮。\n此别岁寒俱努力，临歧何必感离忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登聚仙台","author":"霍尚守","text":"妒人风雨喜初收，千仞危台夏亦秋。\n芳树远分孤屿色，丹崖晴照大江流。\n欣逢谢傅登临兴，笑效卢生汗漫游。\n更听玉箫吹夜月，依稀鸾鹤驻峰头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈参政约王侍御入西樵不至","author":"霍尚守","text":"门前寒影半松堤，枕石餐霞怅独栖。\n千里雪舟期不至，三城烟树望偏迷。\n云中木客听仙舄，谷口梅花待马蹄。\n莫道西园清事足，玉池不减浣花溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙隐岩","author":"霍尚守","text":"洒洒天花落，岩扉隐绛霞。\n瑶池春自漾，疑是赤松家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32399,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小西湖","author":"霍尚守","text":"萧萧残榭枕烟汀，荒径无人薜荔扃。\n断岸落花眠鸀瑦，层峰如障为谁青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32400,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日寄曾人倩","author":"霍尚守","text":"江天咫尺怅离群，一听莺声倍忆君。\n七十芙蓉明月夜，登台曾共细论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32401,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中得黄与东书却寄 其一","author":"霍尚守","text":"春入千峰紫翠平，王阳何事恋江城。\n飞觞曲涧谁同醉，夜雨相思白发生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32402,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中得黄与东书却寄 其二","author":"霍尚守","text":"去年啸月玉台边，吹笛临风思亦仙。\n千树杜鹃迷紫峤，君能不忆醉花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32403,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送章中缶宗师转山东大参 其一","author":"霍尚守","text":"十年戎马暗三韩，曾见豺狼釜峤攒。\n齐鲁长城今借重，妖氛应避惠文冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32404,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送章中缶宗师转山东大参 其二","author":"霍尚守","text":"谢傅风流未易逢，聚仙台上昔追踪。\n于今泰岱归青眼，问俗应登日观峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32405,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送章中缶宗师转山东大参 其三","author":"霍尚守","text":"风吹寒色促征车，一别相思万里馀。\n拓落却怜门下士，赋成搔首愧相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32406,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送章中缶宗师转山东大参 其四","author":"霍尚守","text":"晴空紫气拥华簪，庾岭梅花送去骖。\n满目疮痍堪太息，应怜民力竭东南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32407,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侍御方麓李公还朝 其一","author":"霍尚守","text":"兰台使者远承恩，仗节驰驱到海门。\n绣斧一临氛祲尽，万家桃李醉春暄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32408,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侍御方麓李公还朝 其二","author":"霍尚守","text":"年来榷税正愁繁，封事曾闻达九阍。\n圣主忧民丹诏下，炎方无处不沾恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32409,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侍御方麓李公还朝 其三","author":"霍尚守","text":"飞旌万里肃霜风，当路豺狼尽避骢。\n沟壑疲癃今起色，何人不羡转天功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32410,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侍御方麓李公还朝 其四","author":"霍尚守","text":"孤标清夺越江波，十郡欣逢揽辔过。\n归阙倘承宣室问，具陈民力已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32411,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侍御方麓李公还朝 其五","author":"霍尚守","text":"省方两载传风采，此日乘飙倏五云。\n下士自惭叨彩笔，迂愚何以纪殊勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32412,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登小金山","author":"朱士赞","text":"钟鼓灵洲谁祀典，风流学士尔坡仙。\n金莲曾撤御前烛，赤壁常浮月下船。\n疏草安危元耿耿，炎荒山斗自年年。\n清风不与埋尘土，白发翩翩望俨然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32413,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山飞来寺","author":"朱士赞","text":"九日凭高目，飞来一系篷。\n夹河开石菊，吹帽落金风。\n阅历兴亡里，浮沉变态中。\n考槃吾欲隐，尘世勿王通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺","author":"朱士赞","text":"草玄门外故人疏，抱病天涯叹索居。\n道直自宜双峡隐，家贫常有五车书。\n消愁探杖时呼酒，适兴临江便钓鱼。\n术拙敢言明主弃，笑谈天地几居诸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其一 钓鲤石","author":"朱士赞","text":"异石枕江沮，曾闻钓巨鱼。\n年来波漾月，应是网罗疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其二 归猿洞","author":"朱士赞","text":"逐伴归山去，持环扣寺还。\n千秋传异事，吾意有无间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其三 和光洞","author":"朱士赞","text":"空闻榴五色，幽隐隔蓬莱。\n想在慈山里，云深长绿苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32418,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其四 狮子石","author":"朱士赞","text":"兀兀山巅石，隐然狮子眠。\n多罗一问后，寒暑又千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32419,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其五 达么石","author":"朱士赞","text":"有石峙江干，达么曾坐此。\n谭经自何年，祇见石如砥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32420,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其六 龙磨角石","author":"朱士赞","text":"石上龙磨角，磨痕今若何。\n忽看风骤发，霖雨沛江河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32421,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其七 缥翻岭","author":"朱士赞","text":"曾闻幡挂岭，万里翊王师。\n金鼓仍今日，何因再竖旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32422,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其八 葛坛石","author":"朱士赞","text":"仙令曾勾漏，行踪亦有坛。\n潇潇玄鹤杳，无地觅还丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32423,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其九 韦氏园","author":"朱士赞","text":"韦氏人存否，名园事有无。\n不堪时代远，披棘问荒芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32424,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其十 犀牛潭","author":"朱士赞","text":"文犀无处觅，金锁已尘寰。\n满目沧江迥，渔舟自往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32425,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其十一 定心泉","author":"朱士赞","text":"酌水涤尘襟，临流思不禁。\n定心云止水，不定最人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32426,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其十二 读书坑","author":"朱士赞","text":"深涧迷芳草，晴云鼓枻来。\n王孙何地隐，空有读书台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32427,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其十三 放生池","author":"朱士赞","text":"解网今何世，馀恩及物多。\n乾坤元浩荡，鳞介任清波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32428,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺胜景古迹 其十四 白泡潭","author":"朱士赞","text":"浈江东注日，银浪忽成堆。\n岂有东流柱，盘旋水自回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]